  "formalized": [
    "Lazy continuation search exactly matches eager assignment-list traversal and branch order, including repeated variable lists; production search does not construct the exponential list.",
    "The lazy mixed/general-CNF decision is equivalent to eager decisions, never unsupported on general finite CNF, with at most 2^k counted leaf calls.",
    "Clause restriction evaluates exactly as fixing a bit; restricting a variable forced by a unit preserves satisfiability. Any fuel-bounded sequence of these unit steps preserves SAT.",
    "The unit-prepared general-CNF decision returns some true iff SAT, some false iff UNSAT, never none; empty clause returns false before lazy search.",
    "Selected events in existing metered raw matching BFS are bounded by r+E*(3r+4), for every fuel; E counts explicit occurrences including duplicates. Distinct processing is proved from actual queue invariants."
